    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48080" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θελκ-τήριον</span></b> , τό,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>charm, spell</i>, of the
			girdle of Aphrodite, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνθα τέ οἱ θ. πάντα τέτυκτο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					14.215
				</span></i>
			; of heroic lays, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βροτῶν θελκτήρια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					1.337
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεῶν θ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				8.509
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόνων θελκτήρια</span>
			<i>means of lightening</i> toil, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				670
			</span></i> (s. v.l.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλώσσης ἐμῆς μείλιγμα
				καὶ θ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				886
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεκροῖς θελκτήρια</span>, of
			offerings to the Manes, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IT</u>
				166
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχῆς θ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				559
			</span></i>.</div>
